{"unit_id":"CodeIntegrity__dsh-semble#caveat-1","repo":"CodeIntegrity/dsh-semble","commit":"2cfd67fc8cb30ef2e6ead59061917b6cfac4cd22","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-semble 使用前须知：宿主需能从 PATH 启动 uvx；首次搜索会建立索引并可能下载嵌入模型，耗时可能长于后续查询（见 lib/cli.js:49-50、lib/index.js:143-147）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/cli.js:49-50","lib/index.js:143-147"]}
